messages.content:
Berikut manifest game Bubble Sort Runner sesuai blueprint yang disetujui.

```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "bubble-sort-runner", title: "Bubble Sort Runner", seed: "bubblesort-01",
  theme: { preset: "neon" },

  learning: {
    subject: "Informatika",
    concept: "Fase-fase algoritma Bubble Sort",
    objectives: ["Membedakan fase Bandingkan, Tukar, dan Selesai Putaran pada Bubble Sort"],
    misconceptions: ["Bubble Sort menukar elemen berjauhan, padahal hanya membandingkan dan menukar dua elemen bersebelahan"],
    mode: "category",
    categories: [
      { id: "bandingkan", label: "Bandingkan", color: "#22D3EE" },
      { id: "tukar",      label: "Tukar",      color: "#F472B6" },
      { id: "selesai",    label: "Selesai Putaran", color: "#A78BFA" }
    ],
    items: [
      { id: "bandingkan-a",  label: "Bandingkan A[i] dan A[i+1]", category: "bandingkan", explain: "Membandingkan dua elemen yang bersebelahan." },
      { id: "cek-lebih",     label: "Cek A[i] > A[i+1]",          category: "bandingkan", explain: "Memeriksa urutan dua elemen bertetangga." },
      { id: "lihat-pasangan", label: "Lihat pasangan bersebelahan", category: "bandingkan", explain: "Fokus pada dua elemen yang berdampingan." },
      { id: "tukar-ai",      label: "Tukar A[i] dengan A[i+1]",   category: "tukar",      explain: "Menukar dua elemen bersebelahan yang salah urutan." },
      { id: "geser-kanan",   label: "Geser elemen besar ke kanan", category: "tukar",     explain: "Elemen besar berpindah satu posisi ke kanan." },
      { id: "swap-posisi",   label: "Swap posisi dua elemen",     category: "tukar",      explain: "Menukar posisi dua elemen bertetangga." },
      { id: "terbesar-ujung", label: "Elemen terbesar ke ujung",  category: "selesai",    explain: "Elemen terbesar menempati posisi akhir setelah satu putaran." },
      { id: "kurangi-rentang", label: "Kurangi rentang perbandingan", category: "selesai", explain: "Batas perbandingan menyusut tiap putaran." },
      { id: "ulangi-awal",   label: "Putaran selesai, ulangi",    category: "selesai",    explain: "Satu iterasi tuntas, lanjut iterasi berikutnya." }
    ],
    target: { rotateAfterCorrect: 5, bias: 0.5 }
  },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 360, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 6 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "blok-rusak", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "glitch",     w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 15, speed: 25 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

Game edukasi bertema Neon ini mengajak pemain mengambil langkah Bubble Sort yang cocok dengan fase target (Bandingkan, Tukar, Selesai Putaran). Asumsi penting: karena engine belum mendukung mekanik urutan ketat, langkah-langkah algoritma dipetakan ke pencocokan kategori fase.
